## At the gate

@narrator{code="0010"}: The Hollow Keep has no windows. It doesn't need them. It has never wanted to see out.
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: I can hear them in there. All of them. Still blinking.
@aria{code="0010"}: Then we go in and turn the lights on.
